      "content": "A second Refresh click can re-enable Save while the original refresh is still pending. Refresh remains enabled during refreshing, and `ReviewView.refreshTrade()` returns false immediately for a second call while `reopen()` is in flight; that second call then runs this `finally` and sets `refreshing` to false. Save can consequently submit the old binding before the first refresh finishes. Prevent overlapping refresh calls (for example, with an in-flight ref and by disabling Refresh while refreshing), so only the active request clears the busy state.",
